  "verseCount": 6,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "53",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 53"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "53",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "d"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "To the chief Musician upon Mahalath, Maschil,",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "A Psalm",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of David.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 53:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The fool hath said in his heart,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.53.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.53.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "There is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.53.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.53.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no God. Corrupt are they, and have done abominable iniquity:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.53.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.53.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.53.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.53.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "none that doeth good.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.53.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.53.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 53:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God looked down from heaven upon the children of men, to see if there were",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.53.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.53.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "any",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.53.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.53.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that did understand, that did seek God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.53.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.53.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 53:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Every one of them is gone back: they are altogether become filthy;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.53.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.53.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.53.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.53.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "none that doeth good, no, not one.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.53.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.53.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 53:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Have the workers of iniquity no knowledge? who eat up my people",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.53.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.53.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "as",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.53.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.53.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they eat bread: they have not called upon God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.53.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.53.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 53:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There were they in great fear,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.53.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.53.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "where",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.53.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.53.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no fear was: for God hath scattered the bones of him that encampeth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.53.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.53.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "against",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.53.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.53.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thee: thou hast put",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.53.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.53.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.53.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.53.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to shame, because God hath despised them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.53.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.53.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 53:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oh that the salvation of Israel",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.53.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.53.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "were come",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.53.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.53.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "out of Zion! When God bringeth back the captivity of his people, Jacob shall rejoice,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.53.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.53.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.53.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.53.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Israel shall be glad.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.53.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.53.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
